            "en": "rejoice",
            "ref": "40:75",
            "verse": "ذَٰلِكُم بِمَا كُنتُمْ تَفْرَحُونَ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ بِغَيْرِ ٱلْحَقِّ وَبِمَا كُنتُمْ تَمْرَحُونَ",
            "verseEn": "[The angels will say], \"That was because you used to exult upon the earth without right and you used to behave insolently."
          },
          {
