            "en": "hope",
            "ref": "26:51",
            "verse": "إِنَّا نَطْمَعُ أَن يَغْفِرَ لَنَا رَبُّنَا خَطَـٰيَـٰنَآ أَن كُنَّآ أَوَّلَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ",
            "verseEn": "Indeed, we aspire that our Lord will forgive us our sins because we were the first of the believers.\""
          }
        ]
